  "common_gotchas": [
    "When targeting position, noise follows point normals; missing normals alter the result because normals can be computed implicitly.",
    "`period` must be greater than zero except for Random noise.",
    "Harmonics without roughness, or roughness without harmonics, will not produce the expected harmonic detail."
