  "key_concepts": [
    "Noise SOP perturbs selected point attributes using Noise CHOP style noise functions.",
    "Position noise is applied along point normals, and missing normals can be computed implicitly.",
    "`period` is inverse frequency and must be greater than zero except for Random noise.",
    "Harmonics and roughness both need nonzero values to add harmonic detail.",
    "Transform controls move the sampling point through 3D noise space for reproducible animated looks."
